 Notes and Fixes</a></li><li><a class="block rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm leading-5 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground" href="/guide/unharvest-reverse-farming">Reverse Farming Guide: Upgrades and Mechanics</a></li><li><a class="block rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm leading-5 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground" href="/demo/unharvest-demo-walkthrough">Unharvest demo walkthrough: 100% Field Clear and Artifact Guide</a></li><li><a class="block rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm leading-5 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground" href="/completion/unharvest-speedrun">Unharvest speedrun: Demo Route Strategy and Record Times</a></li><li><a class="block rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm leading-5 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground" href="/completion/unharvest-speedrun-world-record">Unharvest speedrun world record: Current Times and Demo Mechanics</a></li></ul><a class="text-link mt-4" href="/reviews">More in Reviews<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></nav></aside></div><section data-module="keep_exploring" data-link-area="strip" aria-labelledby="keep-exploring" class="mt-14"><h2 id="keep-exploring" class="section-title mb-5">Keep exploring</h2><div class="strip flex gap-[0.85rem]" role="region" aria-label="Keep exploring" tabindex="0" data-dragging="false"><div class="strip-track"><a class="article-card group" draggable="false" href="/completion/unharvest-100-completion"><div class="article-card-cover"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcSet="/images/covers/completion/unharvest-100-completion.360.avif 360w, /images/covers/completion/unharvest-100-completion.640.avif 640w" sizes="(min-width: 6