eight="360" alt="Unharvest Demo: Gameplay Mechanics, Upgrades, and Lore Guide" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></picture></div><div class="article-card-body"><h3>Demo: Gameplay Mechanics, Upgrades, and Lore Guide</h3><p class="line-clamp-3">The Unharvest demo lets players drain life from a wheat field using plague upgrades, locust swarms, and passive spreading abilities.</p></div></a><a class="article-card group" draggable="false" href="/support/unharvest-bugs"><div class="article-card-cover"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcSet="/images/covers/support/unharvest-bugs.360.avif 360w, /images/covers/support/unharvest-bugs.640.avif 640w" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 270px, 78vw"/><img src="/images/covers/support/unharvest-bugs.640.webp" srcSet="/images/covers/support/unharvest-bugs.360.webp 360w, /images/covers/support/unharvest-bugs.640.webp 640w" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 270px, 78vw" width="640" height="360" alt="Unharvest Demo Bugs, Windows 7 Errors, and Known Fixes" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></picture></div><div class="article-card-body"><h3>Demo Bugs, Windows 7 Errors, and Known Fixes</h3><p class="line-clamp-3">Resolve Unharvest bugs including UnityPlayer.dll crashes on Windows 7, camera glitches, harvest FPS drops, and recent patch fixes.</p></div></a><a class="article-card group" draggable="false" href="/guide/unharvest-locusts"><div class="article-card-cover"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcSet="/images/covers/guide/unharvest-locusts.360.avif 360w, /images/covers/guide/unharvest-locusts.640.avif 640w" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 270px, 78vw"/><img src="/images/covers/guide/unharvest-locusts.640.webp" srcSet="/images/covers/guide/unharvest-locusts.360.webp 360w, /images/covers/guide/unharvest-locusts.640.webp 640w" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 270px, 78vw" width="640" height="360" alt="Unharvest Locusts: How to Unlock Swarms and Upgrade Plague Builds" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></picture></div><div class="article-card-body"><h3>Locusts: How to Unlock Swarms and Upgrade Plague Builds</h3><p class="line-clamp-3">Unlock Unharvest locusts for 10,000 souls, trigger swarm strikes with right-click, and boost cooldown, speed, and duration to clear entire fields.</p></div></a><a class="article-card group" draggable="false" href="/guide/unharvest-reach-upgrades"><div class="article-card-cover"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcSet="/images/covers/guide/unharvest-reach-upgrades.360.avif 360w, /images/covers/guide/unharvest-reach-upgrades.640.avif 640w" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 270px, 78vw"/><img src="/images/covers/guide/unharvest-reach-upgrades.640.webp" srcSet="/images/covers/guide/unharvest-reach-upgrades.360.webp 360w, /images/covers/guide/unharvest-reach-upgrades.640.webp 640w" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 270px, 78vw" width="640" height="360" alt="Unharvest Reach Upgrades: Spore Radius and Swarm Range Guide" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></picture></div><div class="article-card-body"><h3>Reach Upgrades: Spore Radius and Swarm Range Guide</h3><p class="line-clamp-3">Unharvest reach upgrades expand your spore infection radius and locust swarm path width. See upgrade costs, radius tiers, and farming progression.</p></div></a></div></div></section><div class="ad-horizontal ad-stack my-10"><div class="ad-measure ad-large" data-ad-placement="728x90"><div class="ad-sized ad-sized-728x90"><div class="mb-2 text-center text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">Advertisement</div><div class="flex w-full justify-center "><iframe width="728" height="90" scrolling="no" style="border:none;flex-shrink:0" title="Ad slot 728x90"></iframe></div></div></div><div class="ad-measure ad-medium" data-ad-placement="468x60"><div class="ad-sized ad-sized-468x60"><div class="mb-2 text-center text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">Advertisement</div><div class="flex w-full justify-center "><iframe width="468" height="60" scrolling="no" style="border:none;flex-shrink:0" title="Ad slot 468x60"></iframe></div></div></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer data-link-area="footer" class="mt-16 border-t border-border bg-card/30"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mb-10 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/40 p-5"><div class="font-bold text-foreground">Unharvest Wiki</div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Unharvest is a single-player reverse-farming incremental simulation game for Windows PC, with a free demo available and the full release planned for December 7, 2026.</p><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5138990/Unharvest/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">Steam Store<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div><p class="mb-8 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">Legal information</p><div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="sm:col-span-2"><h3 class="font-bold text-foreground">Unharvest Wiki</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Unharvest Wiki is an independent, player-made guide site. We cover plague upgrades, demo walkthroughs, completion, environments, and technical support.</p></div><div><h4 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Guides</h4><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/guide">Guide</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/demo">Demo</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/completion">Completion</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/media">Media</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/support">Support</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/world">World</a></